summary:
  A device's refusal is shown again over a pause that has nothing to do with it.

history:
  The Ruark refused a station, and the footer said so. Then a file from
  My Music was played here and paused: the footer read "Could not cast to
  Ruark R5se" where it should read "Paused", because the name stayed until
  the next cast and the footer asks for it before it asks about a pause
  (2026-11-11). The player starting on this computer takes the name down.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              root._castFailedName = "";   // and it is kept only over silence here: the player starting ends it

replace:
              // and it is kept only over silence here: the player starting ends it

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_device_that_refused_the_stream_is_not_cast_to.
  Line-neutral.
